# Session Openings

When the operator opens with a greeting or a catch-up request — "good morning",
"morning", "gm", "where were we", "catch me up", "status", "standup" — read and
follow `.cursor/skills/good-morning/SKILL.md` before replying. It produces the
rundown and checklist the greeting is asking for.

A greeting is a request for a briefing, not authorization to start work. Report,
then wait for the operator to choose a task.
